/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
.env

# Contains live SSH/Navidrome credentials — never versioned.
extra.md

# The ACL schemas Tauri generates during `build.rs` — derived files, rewritten
# on every build.
crates/headshell/gen/
# The app commands' permissions `build.rs` generates from `command_names.rs`
# (D-086) — derived the same way.
crates/headshell/permissions/autogenerated/

# Python intermediate output. The plugins under `plugins/` are distributed as
# **scripts**; their compiled forms do not go into the repository. The rule was
# written after one got in: checking a plugin with `python3 -m py_compile` left
# `plugins/ytmusic/__pycache__/` behind, and `git add -A` silently picked it up.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# spike/ is throwaway prototypes; their output is not versioned
spike/**/__pycache__/
spike/**/.venv/
spike/**/out/
# The `/target` at the root only covers the root; the spike's own build directory
# was 1.2 GB and a single `git add -A` away.
spike/**/target/
spike/**/Cargo.lock
spike/**/report*.json
spike/**/*.log
spike/**/gen/
